### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### MedicamentsController — /api/medicaments
### SEN PharmaFlow — compatible VS Code "REST Client" (Huachao)
### Fichier autonome : contient ses propres logins.
### Prérequis : V018__insert_mock_medicament_referentiel.sql (db/migration-dev)
### doit être appliquée (familles, formes, médicaments de démonstration).
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@password = Password123!

@familleAntalgiqueId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@familleAntibiotiqueId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@familleAntihistaminiqueId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

@formeComprimeId = 61000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@formePommadeId = 61000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

@medicamentParacetamolId = 62000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@medicamentAmoxicillineId = 62000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@medicamentCeftriaxoneId = 62000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@medicamentQuinineId = 62000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005


### 0a. Login — ADMIN_PNA
# @name loginAdminPna
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

