### 1. POST /api/medicaments — créer un médicament complet (ADMIN_PNA / GESTIONNAIRE_PNA / PHARMACIEN_PNA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medicaments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdminPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "IBU400-{{$timestamp}}",
  "nomCommercial": "Ibuprofène Générique",
  "dci": "Ibuprofène",
  "dosage": "400 mg",
  "formeId": "{{formeComprimeId}}",
  "familleId": "{{familleAntalgiqueId}}",
  "voieAdministration": "ORALE",
  "temperatureConservation": "AMBIANTE",
  "programmeSante": "PNDS Douleur",
  "delaiApprovisionnementJours": 30,
  "necessiteOrdonnance": false,
  "fabricant": "Génériques Sénégal",
  "stockMinimum": 5000,
  "stockMaximum": 50000
}


### 2. POST /api/medicaments — créé par PHARMACIEN_PNA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medicaments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPharmacienPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PARACHK-{{$timestamp}}",
  "nomCommercial": "Paracétamol Enfant",
  "dci": "Paracétamol",
  "dosage": "120 mg/5ml",
  "formeId": "{{formeComprimeId}}",
  "familleId": "{{familleAntalgiqueId}}",
  "necessiteOrdonnance": false
}


### 3. POST /api/medicaments — cas limite, seuls les champs obligatoires sont renseignés
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medicaments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdminPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MINIMAL-{{$timestamp}}",
  "nomCommercial": "Médicament minimal",
  "dci": "DCI test",
  "dosage": "10 mg",
  "formeId": "{{formeComprimeId}}",
  "familleId": "{{familleAntalgiqueId}}",
  "necessiteOrdonnance": false
}


